    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "35f9fbab-a039-4767-8a03-8e1ef9dd3950",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "They Don&apos;t Make Em Like They Used To",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ICA_FACILITY",
        "PublicId": "101844798606",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/thefacility/_scene_polarbear_005.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b0e08b65-2688-4940-9899-ba9badf46ff5).Image",
        "Description": "Happy Wednesday!\r\rToday&apos;s a little tricky. I will go ahead and reveal that the only source of explosion accidents on this map are the pickup trucks at the entrance and in the parking lot. These Cuban trucks still use diesel whereas it seems all of the other parked vehicles have been upgraded to EVs.\r\rNow you must find the best way to use these trucks to explode not 1, not 2, not 3, not 4 but 5 targets! I wish the bestest of luck on you my dear 47.\r\rCheers.",
